nt":[{"text":"The body is a JSON object of content type ","type":"text"},{"code":"application\/json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with two members: ","type":"text"},{"code":"api_key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"project token, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"batch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", one object per record, oldest first, with these members:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Member","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Holds"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distinct_id"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The record’s session, its ","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as a lowercase UUID string; the record’s own ","type":"text"},{"code":"EventRecord\/id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when its context has no session","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The event’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event\/name"},{"type":"text","text":", as it is"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"properties","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The event’s stored properties, by name, then the members listed below","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timestamp"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the event was tracked: ISO 8601 in UTC, with milliseconds (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"2026-11-23T14:03:27.512Z"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"uuid","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s "},{"code":"EventRecord\/id","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", as a lowercase UUID string; a redelivered record keeps it"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The session is the only identifier sent, and every event is anonymous: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"properties"},{"type":"text","text":" holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$process_person_profile: false"},{"type":"text","text":", so PostHog makes no person profile, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$geoip_disable: true"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so PostHog doesn’t add a location from the request’s IP address. A record with no session (one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked by a tracker without "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions()"},{"type":"text","text":") is its own anonymous person, linked to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing: PostHog rejects a whole batch when one of its events has no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distinct_id"},{"type":"text","text":". A record a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store recovers after a relaunch keeps its session, so it goes out under the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distinct_id"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$session_id"},{"type":"text","text":" of its first send. PostHog counts a person per "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"distinct_id"},{"type":"text","text":", so its unique users"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are sessions. The session is also sent as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$session_id"},{"type":"text","text":", which PostHog’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sessions and web analytics group events by ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionKey"},{"type":"text","text":" is the UUIDv7 they require); a record"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no session has none. The record’s vendor identifier and trace context, and any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"context value, aren’t sent."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Properties are read through the event’s schema in ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as ","type":"text"},{"code":"PropertyReader","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reads them. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","type":"reference"},{"text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the property is left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out, an element of an array is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and one inside a type the plan can’t map is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property whose name starts with ","type":"text"},{"code":"$","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which only a hand-written ","type":"text"},{"code":"Encodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformance can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"write, or is ","type":"text"},{"code":"distinct_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", is left out and logged at notice level, as PostHog reads those","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names as settings (","type":"text"},{"code":"$set","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"$process_person_profile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") or the identity.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"properties","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" also holds these members, for each of the keys the record’s context has a value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Member"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Holds"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"i